                    <button type="submit" id="submit-btn" class="flex-[2] py-7 text-[11px] font-black text-white bg-emerald-600 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-2xl shadow-emerald-600/40 hover:bg-emerald-500 uppercase tracking-[0.4em] border-b-8 border-emerald-900 transition-all">Commit Stage</button>
